{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45026","headline":"酬姚补阙南仲云溪馆中戏题随书见寄 · 皎然","name":"酬姚补阙南仲云溪馆中戏题随书见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寺溪临使府，风景借仁祠。\n补衮周官贵，能名汉主思。\n卧云知独处，望月忆同时。\n忽枉缄中赠，琼瑶满手持。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45026.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45026","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}